			"name": "Innate Attack",
			"local_notes": "Lore: Pointing a finger and letting the 'Eadbanger go is the one bit of aiming a Weirdboy has properly practised.\n\nDesign: Innate Attack (Projectile) (DX/E, B201) at DX+2 (13) for 4 points, Easy; the skill 'Eadbanger's Crushing Innate Attack build calls for.",
